hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16022","Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, from Malik ibn Anas, from Abu al-Nadr, from Zurah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Jarhad, from his father, from his grandfather, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed by him while he was uncovering his thigh, and he said: Do you not know that the thigh is nakedness."
"16023","Sufyan narrated to us, from Abu al-Nadr, from Zurah ibn Muslim ibn Jarhad, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saw Jarhad in the mosque, and upon him was a cloak, and his thigh had become uncovered, and he said: The thigh is nakedness."
"16024","Sufyan narrated to us, Abu al-Zinad narrated to us, and he said, the family of Jarhad informed me, from Jarhad, he said: The thigh is nakedness."
"16025","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said, Mamar narrated to us, from Abu al-Zinad, from Ibn Jarhad, from his father, he said, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed by me while I was uncovering my thigh, and the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Cover it, for it is of nakedness."
"16026","Abu Amir narrated to us, he said, Zuhayr, meaning Ibn Muhammad, narrated to us, from Abd Allah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil, from Abd Allah ibn Jarhad al-Aslami, that he heard his father Jarhad saying, I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saying: The thigh of the Muslim man is nakedness."
"16027","Ishaq ibn Isa narrated to us, he said, Malik informed me, from Abu al-Nadr, from Zurah ibn Jarhad al-Aslami, from his father, and he was of the people of the bench, he said, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) sat and saw my thigh uncovered, and he said: Cover yourself, do you not know that the thigh is nakedness."
"16028","Husayn ibn Muhammad narrated to us, he said, Ibn Abi al-Zinad narrated to us, from his father, from Zurah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Jarhad, from Jarhad, his grandfather, and a group of Aslam besides him, trustworthy men, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed by Jarhad, and the thigh of Jarhad was uncovered in the mosque, and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said to him: O Jarhad, cover your thigh, for, O Jarhad, the thigh is nakedness."
"16029","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Sufyan, he said, Abu al-Zinad narrated to me, from Zurah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Jarhad, from his grandfather Jarhad, he said, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed, and upon me was a cloak, and my thigh had become uncovered, he said: Cover, for the thigh is nakedness."
